   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: Every change to `out` pushes a part of `s`, so it ends at most `s.len()` bytes long; a capacity is a promise about memory, and programs say their promises (ADR-149 D5).
   = help: Give it the room ahead: `String(capacity: s.len())`; `nikaia fix` writes it.
